# Local configuration: paths, world name, server name, password.
config.sh

# Server binaries fetched with steamcmd (+app_update 298740).
# Several GB, and redistributing them is not ours to do.
game/

# Wine prefixes, whatever they are called. Multi-GB, and drive_c/users/<name>
# leaks the account name through the folder name alone. Regenerate them with
# the bootstrap step.
#
# The glob is deliberate: prefix/ and prefix-mono/ are only the two we happen
# to use. A throwaway prefix-test/ or prefix2/ leaks the account name exactly
# the same way, and naming each one by hand is a filter that fails silently
# the first time someone invents a name.
prefix*/

# Server logs: they contain the server name, player handles, absolute home
# paths and network addresses. The server writes its own inside the prefix,
# which is already ignored above, but start.sh and watchdog.sh DO create
# logs/ here: the Wine console capture, the watchdog log and the crash history.
# The console capture is the server's stdout, so it carries the same handles.
logs/
*.log

# Runtime state written by the watchdog and the start/stop scripts: the lock,
# the restart timestamps and the two flags that say whether the server was
# stopped on purpose or is still starting. Machine state, never source.
run/

# World and server configuration files, live copies included.
# Sandbox.sbc, SANDBOX_0_0_0_.sbs and SpaceEngineers-Dedicated.cfg carry player
# handles, IdentityIds and the server password hash and salt. In normal
# operation they sit inside the Wine prefix, which is already ignored above,
# but editing them by hand is a documented step: a working copy dropped in the
# checkout must never become a commit. Ignore them by name, wherever they land.
SpaceEngineers-Dedicated.cfg
Sandbox.sbc
Sandbox_config.sbc
SANDBOX_0_0_0_.sbs
*.sbc
*.sbs
*.sbsB5
*.vx2

# World backups, however they were taken.
backup-*/
backup-*.cfg
Backup/

# Your own mod list. Only the neutral example is committed.
mods.txt
!mods.example.txt

# Caches and build leftovers.
cache/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Symlink snapshots taken while swapping toolkits: absolute machine paths.
gptk-links-backup/

# macOS noise.
.DS_Store
